 "title": "Deniz's Picture Recipe",
 "theme": "Visual reading, a picture recipe",
 "blurb": "Dad and Deniz are going to make fruit salad, but the recipe from school has no words at all! “I can't read,” says Deniz. Then she discovers that pictures can be read too, and becomes the kitchen's recipe reader.",
 "voiceNames": {
  "deniz": "Deniz",
  "baba": "Dad"
 },
 "pages": [
  {
   "text": "It was Saturday morning. Dad was whistling in the kitchen: fwee-fwoo, fwee-fwoo! “Shall we make fruit salad today?” Deniz jumped for joy. She pinned the card from school onto her little board. “I've got the recipe! A picture recipe!”",
   "hits": {
    "deniz": {
     "say": "I've got the recipe! A picture recipe!"
    },
    "baba": {
     "say": "Fwee-fwoo! Shall we make fruit salad?"
    },
    "kart": {
     "say": "A recipe tells you how to make a dish."
    }
   },
   "hint": "Touch the card!",
   "ask": "Have you ever helped a grown-up in the kitchen? What did you make together?"
  },
  {
   "text": "“Who's going to read the recipe?” said Dad. Deniz's shoulders drooped. “I can't read! I don't know the letters.” Then she looked at the card for a long time. A bubbly bar of soap… A red apple… “Dad! No letters here, just pictures. Pictures can be read too!”",
   "hits": {
