  {
   "text": "Second picture: a red apple! They washed the fruit too and lined it up on the table. Deniz counted one by one: one, two, three, four, five! Dad cheekily held out a carrot: “Six?” Deniz giggled: “A carrot isn't a fruit, Dad! A carrot is a vegetable!”",
